      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found this command that may be a potential permanent fix:\n\n> netsh int ipv4 set dynamic tcp start=49152 num=16384\n\n> netsh int ipv6 set dynamic tcp start=49152 num=16384\n\nfrom here: https://github.com/docker/for-win/issues/3171#issuecomment-554587817\n\nI will report back after a while if I am still having the problem. Maybe this will help some other poor soul with this nonsense.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
